{
 "_comment": "Generic Business Central terms that seed a project's glossary. source: bc = the term standard BC uses (checked against the nl-BE/fr-BE translations of the Base Application), distri = the term DistriApps uses, proposal = our proposal where neither has a usable one. Only generic terms: customer-specific terms live in the customer repo (translation-glossary.json), never here - this file is published.",
